<header><p class="enc-kicker">State</p><h1 class="enc-title">Khwarazmian Empire</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Khwarazmian Empire was a Persianate Muslim state ruled by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/khwarazm">Khwarazm</a> Shahs, which grew from the Khwarazm region into a major power in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/central-asia">Central Asia</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/iran">Iran</a> around 1200. It displaced the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/seljuk-empire">Seljuks</a> in much of the east. After the execution of envoys and merchants sent by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/genghis-khan">Genghis Khan</a>, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mongol-empire">Mongol Empire</a> invaded from 1219 and destroyed the empire in a devastating campaign.</p></div>
